OL,5,G2200 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FReturn of the series in which
OL,8,     Flife-saving and life-changing
OL,9,     Foperations involve split-second
OL,10,     Fdecisions. Sajid has a massive
OL,11,     Faneurysm. If it bursts, he will
OL,12,     Fbleed to death.
OL,13,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,14,     FWhen 70-year-old Peter arrives at
OL,15,     Fhospital with a dangerously high
OL,16,     Fheart rate, Dr Chris and the
OL,17,     Fmedical team have to act fast to
OL,18,     Fprevent him going into cardiac
OL,19,     Farrest.
