OL,5,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FThe first episode of the new
OL,7,     Fseries features a lipoma so large
OL,8,     Fit may not be safe to tackle under
OL,9,     Flocal anaesthetic, and a woman
OL,10,     Fwho's had alopecia for over 20
OL,11,     Fyears.
OL,12,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FMohammed is back about his swollen
OL,14,     Fleg, which is getting more painful
OL,15,     Fand now makes walking difficult.
OL,16,     FOther cases include a worrying
OL,17,     Farmpit lump, and long-term
OL,18,     Fdepression and anxiety.
